        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "1d3abcdc-f48a-5318-beb6-9020fc13c0ca",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 835,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.140:block:1",
          "start": 379
        },
        "quote": "(b) Moneys from the fund shall be used to promote, stimulate, and improve economic development in the City of Topeka and its environs, to encourage and assist in the location of new business, and the expansion, relocation, or retention of existing business, industry, and health development. To further the goal of economic development, moneys from the fund may be expended for or transferred to, specifically for, but not limited to, the Topeka arts fund.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.140:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
