          "end": 1118,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.140:block:2",
          "start": 836
        },
        "quote": "(c) Moneys from the City’s general fund, origination fees collected from economic development revenue bonds issued by the City pursuant to K.S.A. 12-1740 , et seq., and moneys from any other source legally available for such purpose may be credited to the economic development fund.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.25.140:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
