        },
        "quote": "(d) All transfer or expenditure of moneys from the economic development fund shall be only for the purposes of this section and shall be specifically authorized by the City Manager. (Ord. 18730 § 5, 10-17-06; Ord. 18160 § 1, 1-13-04. Code 1995 § 2-335.)",
